# HR Analytics Report

1. Executive Summary
This report provides an organizational overview of headcount, compensation structure, and bonus allocations across departments and regional hubs based on employee records from the HR Database.

The primary objective is to evaluate payroll allocation efficiency, identify compensation imbalances, and establish baseline workforce metrics for organizational planning.

