Key Departmental Observations
R&D Drives Overall Spend: R&D commands the highest share of the total compensation pool ($26,525.56, or ~25.0%) and maintains the highest departmental average base salary ($3,235.79).

Technical Division Bonus Weight: While Technical staff have the lowest base pay average ($1,487.50), their bonus allocation ($2,620.00) represents a substantial 44.0% of their base salary spend.

Unstaffed Business Units: The catalog lists 9 defined units, but Testing (Dept ID 70) and Maintenance (Dept ID 90) currently record 0 employees, representing either vacant divisions or outsourced services.

