Key Geographic Observations
Primary Delivery Hubs: Chennai, Hyderabad, and Delhi account for 71.4% of the entire organizational workforce.

Salary Disparity: Pune exhibits the highest average base compensation ($3,510.00), driven by specialized technical/R&D roles, while Delhi averages the lowest among major named hubs ($2,038.68).

5. Strategic Recommendations
Standardize Location Metadata: Normalize non-standard location strings (aaa, bbb) during the Power Query ETL pipeline to maintain clean geographic reporting.

Review Incentive Equity: 20% of employees (7 individuals) received no bonus incentive. Align eligibility criteria to ensure performance bonuses are transparently measured across technical and support functions.

Address Zero-Staffed Departments: Audit Testing and Maintenance departments in the database to determine whether to archive inactive cost centers or initiate hiring pipelines.
